==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|netze}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|nezzi|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*natją}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*ned-||to turn, twist, knot}}. Akin to Dutch {{term|net|lang=nl}}, Low German {{m|nds|Nett}}, English {{term|net|lang=en}}, Danish {{m|da|net}}, Swedish {{term|nät|lang=sv}}.

===Noun===
{{de-noun|n|Netzes|Netze}}
# [[net]]
# [[internet]]/[[Internet]] (short for [[Weltnetz]], [[Zwischennetz]])

